From tom at kednos.com  Fri May  7 17:39:07 2004
From: tom at kednos.com (Tom Linden)
Date: Fri, 7 May 2004 10:39:07 -0700
Subject: Miata (PWSnnn) questions
Message-ID: <NDEMLKKEBOIFBMJLCECIIEFDDDAA.tom@kednos.com>

I have several of these PWS500au and PWS600au and XP1000

1.  Two of these won't power back up automatically
    after break in power, several others will.  I have taken 
    them apart and compared them and can't see any difference.
    Now there are some differences as the boards represent different
    revisions I imagine.  Anybody know how to solve this vexing problem?

2.  Anybody have a hardware manual in Electronic form?  Or
    superfluous hardcopy?

3.  Speed setting.  The DIP switch on the PCI board has the following
    settings for a 500au and a 600au.  Is this how it is clocked?
    Anybody have a definition of this switch?

	500		600

1	off		off
2	on		on
3	on		on
4	off		on
5	off		on
6	off		off
7	off		on
8	on		on


