From: mzyngier at freesurf.fr (Marc Zyngier)
Date: Wed, 12 May 2004 15:53:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] EISA DMA API support
Message-ID: <wrpoeotvjir.fsf@panther.wild-wind.fr.eu.org>

People,

I found some time to resurect the Jensen once again, and give the
latest 2.6 a go on the old thing...

The only missing thing in vanilla 2.6 is proper support for the DMA
API on the EISA bus (required by the aha1740 driver).

The following patch, by Ivan Kokshaysky, adds this support (I've been
running 2.5/2.6 on the Jensen with this patch for months). I simply
updated it and rediffed it against latest 2.6-bk.

With this patch applied, the Jensen runs nicely (and doubles as a
space heater... ;-).

Any comment ?

	M.

